OL,3,GNEWSAOyster shipment an 'encouraging
OL,4,Amilestone'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn "encouraging milestone" was reached
OL,7,Fafter Jersey oysters were successfully
OL,8,Fexported using a new service at a
OL,9,Ffacility in Granville, officials have
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FThe island's government said Jersey
OL,13,FOyster Company's successful shipment
OL,14,Fthrough the new Service d'Inspection
OL,15,FVeterinaire et Phytosanitaire (SIVEP)
OL,16,Fat the Port of Granville marked "an
OL,17,Fimportant step forward" for the
OL,18,Faquaculture industry.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
