OL,3,GNEWSAOyster shipment an 'encouraging
OL,4,Amilestone'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMinister for the Environment,
OL,7,FAgriculture and Fisheries Senator Mary
OL,8,FLe Hegarat said the island would
OL,9,Fcontinue to work with French
OL,10,Fcounterparts to expand the range of
OL,11,Fspecies it would accept.
OL,13,F"This helps to reduce some of the
OL,14,Fchallenges and costs introduced by
OL,15,FBrexit," she said.
